            "text": "<p>During pregnancy, the abdominal muscles move apart to make room for the baby. For many women that gap narrows on its own; for others it stays for years. Walking, swimming and yoga are great for your health, but they don't always change how your midsection looks in clothes.</p>"
          }
        },
